'''Cat Army''' (にゃんこ軍団, ''Nyanko Gundan'', '''Cat Army''') is a 5-slot [[Cat Combo]] that was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]]. This is the first Cat Combo the player ever unlocks.

==Effect==
'''Current Version''': Worker Cat Start Level Up (Sm): Worker Cat's initial level starts with +1.

'''Pre 4.7''': Starting Money Up (Sm): Wallet starts with 300¢.

